ok:Lecithin|lecithin]] powder (optional) \n*3 or more whole [[Cookbook:Green Onion|spring onions]], [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]]\n*1 or more pickled gherkin, chopped\n*[[Cookbook:Margarine|Margarine]]\n*[[Cookbook:Rapeseed Oil|Rapeseed oil]] or other [[Cookbook:Vegetable oil|vegetable oil]]\n*[[Cookbook:Salt|Salt]]\n*[[Cookbook:Pepper|Pepper]]\n\n==Procedure==\n# Combine tofu, oat flakes, raw spelt, and some water.\n# If desired, mix in the lecithin to act as an emulsifier.\n# Mix in the spring onion and gherkins.\n# Mix in a spoonful of margarine and/or rapeseed oil.\n# Add salt and pepper to taste.\n\n[[Category:Vegan recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using spelt flour]]\n[[Category:Recipes using tofu]]\n[[Category:Appetizer recipes]]\n[[Category:Spread recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes with metric units]]\n[[Category:Recipes using vegetable oil]]\n[[Category:Recipes using margarine]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Spring Onion Spelt Spread","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"250 g tofu","sourceText":"250 g tofu","amountText":"250 g tofu","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"150 g oat flakes","sourceText":"150 g oat flakes","amountText":"150 g oat flakes","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"150 g raw spelt flour","sourceText":"150 g raw spelt flour","amountText":"150 g raw spelt flour","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"Soy lecithin powder (optional)","sourceText":"Soy lecithin powder (optional)","amountText":"Soy lecithin powder (optional)","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"3 or more whole spring onions, chopped","sourceText":"3 or more whole spring onions, chopped","amountText":"3 or more whole spring onions, chopped","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"1 or more pickled gherkin, chopped","sourceText":